# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT — IMMERSIVE 3D VIRTUAL CINEMA EXPERIENCE

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, premium, realistic, interactive 3D Virtual Cinema Website.

The website allows users to enter a virtual cinema, select their preferred theater category, choose their exact seat, upload their own videos, arrange their video playlist, and experience watching those videos inside a realistic 3D cinema auditorium.

This is NOT a traditional movie-ticket booking website.

This is an interactive virtual cinema platform where users experience their uploaded videos inside a realistic virtual theater.

The most important objective is to make users feel as though they are physically sitting inside a real cinema auditorium.

The website must have multiple cinema categories, and every category must have its own unique architecture, screen dimensions, seating arrangement, lighting, materials, atmosphere, and audio experience.

Build the entire project as one connected application.

