# FINAL EXPECTATION

The finished result must be a complete browser-based virtual cinema.

A user must be able to select a theater, choose a seat, upload their own videos, arrange a playlist, enter the 3D theater, sit in their selected seat, watch actual videos on the theater screen, experience automatic cinematic lighting, hear the video audio and return home after the show.

The six theater categories must feel like six different cinema environments.

The project must be functional without a database, API keys, external AI services, payment services or cloud video storage.

The priority is REALISTIC 3D, ACTUAL VIDEO PLAYBACK, CORRECT SEAT POSITIONING, DIFFERENT THEATER ARCHITECTURE and A COMPLETE CINEMA EXPERIENCE.

Do not compromise these core requirements just to finish the visual design quickly.